    <h1>Why DHT Blockers Are the Most Effective Way to Address Genetic Hair Loss</h1>
    <p class="vy-dek">Here's what's actually happening to your hair follicles, and why addressing DHT is the most direct way to slow it down.</p>
    <div class="vy-byline">
